# Goal: the pose the turtle must reach
TargetPose target
---
# Result
bool success
TargetPose final_pose
float64 position_error   # [m]   distance between final pose and target
float64 yaw_error        # [rad] wrapped heading error at the end
string message
---
# Feedback
TargetPose current_pose
float64 remaining_distance  # [m]
float64 remaining_angle     # [rad] heading error w.r.t. the active phase
string phase                # ROTATE_TO_TARGET | DRIVE_TO_TARGET | ROTATE_TO_YAW
